            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CyberChefv25"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This year was my first time brining my meat. I used this as the base brine on my Christmas cornish hens. I added a few other spices, a little smoked paprika and red pepper for a kick.\nThe hens baked and the flavor was throughout the meat. They baked evenly and we're moist. \nMy family loved them. I can't wait to try it this summer with other meats and cooking methods.",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-28T19:10:01.390Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
